  "_doc": "WS-MDC CC-2 (my_day_command_centre.md §9.2, D-MD-2): is a task in the member's Today, and why? One member, one local day. `task` holds the shared facts: the stated disposition of the member and the effective one that the client gets, the lane category, who is assigned (`me`, `other` or null), and the dates. `mine` holds the member's own overlay and day state: the focus mark, the block and the One Thing. `why` lists the arms that hold, in the order one_thing, focus, scheduled, due. An empty `why` is a task outside the set. The `due` arm alone is the old rule. Readers: tests/unit/test_today_rule_r8.py (mine.in_today and personal.effective_disposition hermetic, today_rule.today_set_sql on Postgres), workbench/control_plane/src/lib/shell/todayRule.test.ts (todayRule.ts todayWhy and today.ts isInToday).",
